---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About Mental Wellness & Relationship Services | MWRS">
  <main class="about-page">

    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="subpage-hero">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h1>About MWRS</h1>
        <p>
          Mental Wellness &amp; Relationship Services (MWRS) is a
          counseling and medication management practice serving
          individuals, couples, and families across North Idaho. Our
          team includes counselors, social workers, marriage and
          family therapists, and nurse practitioners working together
          to provide steady, human-sized mental health care.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Start counseling or medication care
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Body -->
    <section class="about-body">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Who we are</h2>
        <p>
          MWRS is a locally rooted mental health practice with offices
          in Coeur d'Alene, Ponderay, Priest River, and Oldtown,
          Idaho, along with telehealth options for residents across
          the state. We focus on practical, relationship-centered care
          that feels calm, clear, and workable in real life.
        </p>
        <p>
          Our clinicians draw from approaches such as CBT, EMDR, IFS,
          attachment-based work, somatic and trauma-informed care, and
          skills-based therapies. Underneath the techniques, the core
          of our work is relationship, safety, and clear next steps.
        </p>

        <h3>Who we serve</h3>
        <p>
          We work with adults, teens, and families navigating anxiety,
          depression, trauma, relationship strain, grief, life
          transitions, and the everyday weight of being human. Some
          people come in with a very specific concern; others are
          simply looking for a steady place to sort things out over
          time.
        </p>

        <ul>
          <li>Individual counseling for adults and teens</li>
          <li>Couples and marriage counseling</li>
          <li>Family counseling</li>
          <li>Equine-assisted therapy in Oldtown</li>
          <li>Medication management for Idaho and Washington residents</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>Access to care</h3>
        <p>
          MWRS works with a wide range of insurance plans and offers a
          Sliding Fee Discount Program based on household size and
          income. No one is denied care due to an inability to pay.
        </p>
        <p>
          You can learn more in our
          <a href="/services#sliding-fee">Sliding Fee Discount Program</a>
          section or by submitting a request through our intake form.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <section class="about-cta">
      <div class="section-inner">
        <h2>Ready to take the next step?</h2>
        <p>
          Whether you're certain about what you need or just starting
          to explore options, we'll meet you where you are and walk
          through it together.
        </p>
        <a href="/contact-us" class="btn-outline btn-outline--counseling">
          Start counseling or medication care
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <style>
    .about-page {
      background: #f9fafb;
      min-height: 100vh;
    }

    /* ── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .subpage-hero {
      padding: 10rem 1.5rem 3rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .subpage-hero h1 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 3vw, 2.6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .subpage-hero p {
      margin: 0 0 1.6rem;
      font-size: 1rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Shared section wrapper ───────────────────────── */
    .section-inner {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* ── Body section ─────────────────────────────────── */
    .about-body {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.2rem;
      background-color: #e5e9f3;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.08);
    }

    .about-body h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .about-body h3 {
      margin: 1.1rem 0 0.6rem;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .about-body p {
      margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .about-body ul {
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      padding-left: 1.1rem;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    .about-body li + li {
      margin-top: 0.2rem;
    }

    .about-body a {
      color: #9b8ec4;
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    .about-body a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }

    /* ── CTA section ──────────────────────────────────── */
    .about-cta {
      padding: 3rem 1.5rem 3.2rem;
      background-color: #fbfbf9;
      background-image: url("/images/paper-texture.png");
      background-repeat: repeat;
      background-size: 420px 420px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .about-cta h2 {
      font-family: "Belleza", sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin: 0 0 1rem;
      color: #111827;
    }

    .about-cta p {
      max-width: 620px;
      margin: 0 auto 1.6rem;
      font-size: 0.96rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
      color: #4b5563;
    }

    /* ── Outline button ───────────────────────────────── */
    .btn-outline {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 0.85rem 1.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-decoration: none;
      background: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 6px 16px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.12);
      transition: background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease,
        box-shadow 0.15s ease, transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling {
      border-color: #7d6fb3;
      color: #7d6fb3;
    }

    .btn-outline--counseling:hover {
      background: #7d6fb3;
      color: #ffffff;
      transform: translateY(-1px);
      box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(125, 111, 179, 0.3);
    }
  </style>
</Layout>